    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár waawutmo Nebukadnesa oo Babuloni nee slaqwaruuseerós, nee slaqwaruusér xoordaá hatlá', kudá' inós aa baál, tawa slaqwi nee Yerusalemu nee gixsadaá iisaapaydá'. Axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Yeremia gana axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, a kah, «Tláw, waawutmo Sedekia oo Yuda ku beer, ‹Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gixsarí a qaás baraá dabaá waawutmoó Babuloni, nee gari daa/ ar asla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng a baloó kotsoqotká dirose, ala looeemaawo, kuúng tu oh, turi baraá dabaawós i qaas. Iltók nee tós ti doogiyá', nee tari axwesá' nee inós, aluuwo kuúng turi ar tláy ay Babuloni.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe, kuúng Sedekia, waawutmoó Yuda, axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ daanduuwoge iiárií qaaseek, kuúng tu gaasiiká ar slaqwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuúng a gwá' ar wayda, adoodá' baabi'iiwók kira mooyángw tsuú' i da/aa/án, nee adoodá' waawitaádá' diroge aa giirin kura mooyángw tsuú' i da/aa/án, kuúng sleeme tu adoodá' /iis. Kuúng tu sa tsuunqumiis, nee tawa kaahi, ‹Ooyeey, waawutmoorén aa gwaá'!› Asma anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kangwí nguna oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Yeremia kangwdá' guri dír waawutmo Sedekia i oó' baraá Yerusalemúr wa aleeró. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaarihe slaqwaruusér waawutmoó Babuloni ta slaaqw nee gixsár Yerusalemu, nee gixsadaá hatlá' awa Yuda, kudá' naa meetiye' adór gixsár Lakishi nee Aseka, asma an gixsadaá koo/i gawden baraá yaamaá Yudawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí an axweesantadár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Yeremia aa axaás, alaá waawutmo Sedekia nee muu sleémeero oo Yerusalemu al'axweesani ngiwa qaasiyé', ar muu kuwa gweeri baraá tseegamooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muk'ín oo Yahudi kudá' aa lawaale tleehhiit, hhawaate nee /ameenaaro, as kahhó' hee tumu wák heé Israeli munguwa lawaalmo tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu sleémeero nee geeraharuuser'ín, kudá' alqadoodá' ngaa ya/ane' tari kaahi slayé', as lawaale kawa gweeri ar hhawaate nee /ameenaaro, nee tawa kumiitiiká muu lawaalér wa ohiingo. Inooín muu kuri gweér. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo inslaway'ín kuri warqeés, tari kumiít muu kuwa lawaalér wa ohin, hhawaate nee /ameenaaro, kudá' aáng taa gweér.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Yeremia gari axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli i kaahi, ‹Alqado ana qaás nee baabi'iihúng, qoomár ngiwa baraá yaamaá Misrír wa duúx, qoomár inooín tawa lawaale, ngiri báw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umuú kurkú faanqwe, umuú heewo dirhunge, hhiyaawós oo Yahudi kudá' ta dirósí weeriís, aqo gun gweer alaá lawaali'iimár kureeraá lahhooe. Kár ala baabi'iihúng tidá' aníng ngaa báw, ngaa axasi'iiká, nee ngaa iiárií qaasi'iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala deelór niina aa waarahhi, kuungá' inslawayhúng kuwa warqesé', aníng ina qwal/asé'. Kuungá' mukhúng oo Israeli kuwa gwedé', nee alqado kari qasé' dír geeraaeé' wa alé, dír Do'odá' taa umuueénár ateetin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo kuungá' tari daambaraatsité', umuueé' kuri meetagasé', qoomár lawaale sleémeero tidá' taa gwedité', ar hhawaate nee /ameenaaro, kawa malé ohiindé', kari ki/isé' ar /uuru baraá lawaali'iima.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hám daxta, anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ a kah, As kuungá' aníng iwa iialooeesi'iiká, as lawaaleedá' kawa gwedi'iiká. Ar ló', aluuwo aníng kuungá' nu gweér, aníng kuungá' nu gweér as tunduwa tsu/i ar paánga, nee giyeé nee tiqtír pu/i. Aníng xoordu sleémeero i dae tsaát, qoomár birnga axaasiyé' tidá' ni tleehh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee múk alqador'eé' gaa geexay, nee hara'ayar'eé' eeharto ga sii', tidá' taa tleéhh geeraaeé' wa alé, inooín in slaqás nee damár taa gaás, kari tla/a feehhiís amorqá' nee tiqá', nee muu iri baraá tla/angwdár waaraáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí a geeraharuusér múk Yuda, nee geeraharuusér múk Yerusalemu, nee mukdaádá' taa karmuumúy, nee kaahamuuseero dinkwa nee muu sleémeero kudá' damaadá' gaa waa waraahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng inooín i baraá dabaá wakuuser'ínií qaás, nee baraá dabaá mukdá' inooín gi tsu/utár wa slaá'. Tu'uuín tari /aymár tsir/ór gawaá doori nee makaá sla/a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sedekia waawutmoó Yuda dinkwa nee geeraharuuseerós, aníng in qaás baraá dabaá wakuuser'ín, nee baraá dabaá mukdá' inooín tsu/utár wa slaá', nee baraá dabaá slaqwaruusér waawutmoó Babuloni, kudá' slaqwara ngaa maye', nu i haratlatlawa'aaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ a kah, ga/aaweek, aníng inooín i ádbáw as gixsarí ngiwa malé inki/iya' slaqwaraaro, nee gixsarí ngiri hayoohiyá', nee ngiri da/iyá' ar asla. Aníng gixsadaá Yuda i xaanxay tleéhh, tam múk gi hoót iri qwaar.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
